  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">UNFCC LEG PAYMENT 2023</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Least Developed Countries Expert Group (LEG) is the only Constituted Body mandated by the UNFCCC to specifically address the need of Least Developed Countries in advancing climate action. It operates on a rolling two-year work programme, the most recent of which (2023-2024) was endorsed by Parties to the Convention during the June 2023 Subsidiary Body for Implementation (SBI) session in Bonn. The detailed LEG work programme for that period is in the file.</narrative>
  </description>
